# PASS goes after CAP LS, which servers accept, and before NICK, which
# they require.
= server-password s3cret pass
> CAP LS 302
> PASS :s3cret pass
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.example CAP * LS :multi-prefix
> CAP REQ multi-prefix
< :irc.example CAP * ACK multi-prefix
> CAP END
< :irc.example 001 textual :Welcome
? registered textual
